  control statements: 3 types

Types of Control Statements:

1. Decision-Making Statements

if, if-else, else-if(ladder), nested if, switch

2. Looping Statements

for, while, do-while, enhanced for

3. Jump Statements

break, continue, return
# For Each Loop in Java||enhanced for
The for-each loop in Java is used to access each element of an array or collection one by one without using an index.

It is also called an Enhanced For Loop.
Syntax
